"""Phase A: compare B1 anchors with B2.1 under one validation contract.

This module is deliberately aggregate-only at its public API.  It re-runs the
locked B2.1 model selection, evaluates B1 on the same supervised cohorts, and
reports whether the two systems make complementary within-study ranking errors.
No participant identifiers or row-level predictions are returned.
"""

